      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "@Inject HEAD cancellable on DynamicOffsets.calcDynamicOffsets: one pass over the blocks of the swept region's box keeps the blocks that can be hit (non-empty collision shape for the camera entity, not exempted by the method's own predicate); none: the method's no-hit result; @Redirect of the loop's IObjectPicker.clip: a step whose segment box holds no kept block answers a shared miss result; a plan that does not pay (over 16 kept blocks, or under 8 traces skipped) leaves the next 1, 2, 4 ... 32 calls unplanned (helper bons.furious.patch.shouldersurfing_c49.CameraSweep)",
      "license": "Shoulder Surfing Reloaded (MIT): no Shoulder Surfing code is carried; the pre-scan calls the mod's own predicate and Minecraft's shape methods"
    },
